Vault for Multi-cloud Environments
Lab Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Install and configure HashiCorp Vault on a Linux machine
Set up Vault authentication methods for AWS, Azure, and GCP
Create and manage secrets across multiple cloud environments
Configure secure secret access policies for multi-cloud scenarios
Implement cross-cloud secret sharing and access controls
