Troubleshooting Tips
Common Issues and Solutions
Issue 1: Vault server not starting

Solution: Check if port 8200 is already in use: netstat -tlnp | grep 8200
Kill any existing processes and restart Vault
Issue 2: Authentication failures

Solution: Verify token is not expired: vault token lookup
Renew token if needed: vault token renew
Issue 3: Permission denied errors

Solution: Check policy assignments: vault token lookup -format=json | jq .data.policies
Verify policy contents: vault policy read <policy-name>
Issue 4: Secret engine not responding

Solution: Check if secret engine is enabled: vault secrets list
Re-enable if necessary: vault secrets enable -path=<path> <engine-type>
